Emerging Market Opportunities
Development of Next-Generation Battery Chemistries
Research into solid-state and lithium-sulfur batteries creates opportunities for aviation battery manufacturers. These technologies have the potential to improve energy density and safety, supporting future aircraft designs and new onboard electrical applications.

Growth of Urban Air Mobility and eVTOL Aircraft
Electric vertical take-off and landing aircraft require high-performance battery systems capable of delivering substantial power and supporting repeated charging cycles. The development of urban air mobility platforms creates an emerging opportunity for suppliers with aviation-grade battery expertise.

Expansion of Battery MRO and Lifecycle Services
As aircraft battery installations increase, demand for battery testing, health monitoring, refurbishment, and recycling services is also expected to develop. Manufacturers and service providers can strengthen their market positions through lifecycle support and specialized maintenance solutions.

